# The two image builds need only the package's own inputs: bench/Dockerfile copies
# pyproject.toml + packages/, and orchestration/Dockerfile also reads uv.lock for its
# frozen install and bakes the three deep-config files the registered knob-sweep reads on the
# worker (model.yaml, the sweep grid, the vLLM redeploy manifest). packages/ carries the
# slipstream-contract workspace member both installs resolve through [tool.uv.sources].
# Everything else — terraform state, the rest of the cluster manifests, docs, git, caches,
# results — stays out of the build context so it can't bloat or leak into a layer. The three
# config files are named individually, not by their directories, so bench/ and k8s/ otherwise
# stay excluded.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages
!model.yaml
!bench/sweep-grid.yaml
!k8s/vllm-gpu.yaml
